":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":391232995,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzOTEyMzI5OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:assetlib","name":"topic:assetlib","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-10-16T21:56:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:37:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7.2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - Windows 11 (build 26300) - Direct3D 12 (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAnimated webp images are displayed correctly on the Godot Asset Store website, but fail to render in the Godot editor's integrated asset store.\n\nInstead of displaying the animation, the editor shows a broken image icon in the gallery.\n\n#### Expected behavior\n\nAnimated WebP images should play correctly in the integrated Asset Store, just as they do in modern web browsers.\n\nIf animation support is not available, the editor should at least display the first frame as a static preview instead of showing a broken image icon.\n\n#### Actual behavior\n\nThe animated WebP image is not displayed at all. Only a broken image icon appears.\n\n#### Additional information\n\nGodot already uses libwebp for static WebP decoding. The library also provides animation decoding functionality through WebPAnimDecoder.\n\nSupporting animated WebP images in the Asset Store gallery should therefore be technically feasible without requiring general-purpose animated image support throughout the engine.\n\nAt minimum, displaying the first frame would prevent broken previews.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd a animated .webp to a store addon and look inside the editor's integrated asset store.\n\n<img width=\"501\" height=\"450\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/daee7176-2f9f-4e16-9452-b1fb941137ef\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\ndoesn't fit here","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124563/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}